#: appinstaller.rs:905
msgid "This app is installed already. Installing it again replaces it."
msgstr "Bu ilova allaqachon o‘rnatilgan. Qayta o‘rnatish uni almashtiradi."

#: appinstaller.rs:908
msgid "Apps from .deb packages become part of the system. A MAN update replaces the system, so they are only installed again after an update if you keep them (next steps)."
msgstr ".deb paketlaridagi ilovalar tizimning bir qismiga aylanadi. MAN yangilanishi tizimni almashtiradi, shuning uchun yangilanishdan keyin ular faqat saqlasangiz qayta o‘rnatiladi (keyingi qadamlar)."

#: appinstaller.rs:911
msgid "Only install apps from sources you trust."
msgstr "Ilovalarni faqat ishonchli manbalardan o‘rnating."

#: appinstaller.rs:917
msgid "Where do you want to install {name}?"
msgstr "{name} qayerga o‘rnatilsin?"

#: appinstaller.rs:922
msgid "Only your account can use the app."
msgstr "Ilovadan faqat sizning hisobingiz foydalana oladi."

#: appinstaller.rs:923
msgid "Needs administrator rights."
msgstr "Administrator huquqlari kerak."

#: appinstaller.rs:930
msgid "Only for Me"
msgstr "Faqat men uchun"

#: appinstaller.rs:930
msgid "For All Users of This Computer"
msgstr "Bu kompyuterning barcha foydalanuvchilari uchun"

#: appinstaller.rs:945
msgid "This will take {size} of space on your computer."
msgstr "Bu kompyuteringizda {size} joy egallaydi."

#: appinstaller.rs:947
msgid "The app is downloaded from {source}."
msgstr "Ilova {source} manbasidan yuklab olinadi."

#: appinstaller.rs:949
msgid "The app is installed for all users of this computer."
msgstr "Ilova bu kompyuterning barcha foydalanuvchilari uchun o‘rnatiladi."

#: appinstaller.rs:949
msgid "The app is installed only for you."
msgstr "Ilova faqat siz uchun o‘rnatiladi."

#: appinstaller.rs:952
msgid "The AppImage is moved to {folder} and added to your apps."
msgstr "AppImage {folder} jildiga ko‘chiriladi va ilovalaringizga qo‘shiladi."

#: appinstaller.rs:958
msgid "Keep After MAN Updates"
msgstr "MAN yangilanishlaridan keyin ham saqlash"

#: appinstaller.rs:959
msgid "MAN installs the app again after each update. Its package files are kept for that."
msgstr "MAN har bir yangilanishdan keyin ilovani qayta o‘rnatadi. Buning uchun uning paket fayllari saqlanadi."

#: appinstaller.rs:967
msgid "Click Install to install {name}."
msgstr "{name} o‘rnatish uchun “O‘rnatish” tugmasini bosing."

#: appinstaller.rs:973
msgid "Checking what else the app needs…"
msgstr "Ilovaga yana nima kerakligi tekshirilmoqda…"

#: appinstaller.rs:983
msgid "Also installs the packages it needs: {list}"
msgstr "Kerakli paketlarni ham o‘rnatadi: {list}"

#: appinstaller.rs:989
msgid "Some packages the app needs are not available yet. Installing gets the newest package lists first; if they are still missing, the app cannot be installed."
msgstr "Ilovaga kerakli ba’zi paketlar hali mavjud emas. O‘rnatish avval eng yangi paketlar ro‘yxatini oladi; agar ular hali ham yetishmasa, ilovani o‘rnatib bo‘lmaydi."

#: appinstaller.rs:1050
msgid "Installing {name}…"
msgstr "{name} o‘rnatilmoqda…"

#: appinstaller.rs:1056
msgid "Preparing…"
msgstr "Tayyorlanmoqda…"

#: appinstaller.rs:1063
msgid "Details"
msgstr "Tafsilotlar"

