msgid "Authorization was cancelled."
msgstr "Avtorizatsiya bekor qilindi."

#: backend.rs:87
msgid "Administrator rights are needed for this action."
msgstr "Bu amal uchun administrator huquqlari kerak."

#: backend.rs:89
msgid "The system helper stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Tizim yordamchisi kutilmaganda toʻxtadi."

#: installer.rs:78
msgid "No EFI system partition"
msgstr "EFI tizim boʻlimi yoʻq"

#: installer.rs:82
msgid "Only {free} free, MAN needs {need}. Make more room with DUHACH! in Windows."
msgstr "Faqat {free} boʻsh, MAN uchun {need} kerak. Windows’da DUHACH! yordamida joy boʻshating."

#: installer.rs:83
msgid "No free space. Start DUHACH! in Windows to make room for MAN."
msgstr "Boʻsh joy yoʻq. MAN uchun joy ochish uchun Windows’da DUHACH!’ni ishga tushiring."

#: installer.rs:92
msgid "MAN is running from this disk"
msgstr "MAN shu diskdan ishlayapti"

#: installer.rs:96
msgid "In use: a partition is mounted"
msgstr "Foydalanilmoqda: boʻlim ulangan"

#: installer.rs:98
msgid "Too small, MAN needs {need}"
msgstr "Juda kichik, MAN uchun {need} kerak"

#: installer.rs:108
msgid "Install MAN"
msgstr "MAN’ni oʻrnatish"

#: installer.rs:126
msgid "MAN is being installed. Please wait until it finishes."
msgstr "MAN oʻrnatilmoqda. Tugashini kuting."

#: installer.rs:143
msgid "Language"
msgstr "Til"

#: installer.rs:155
msgid "_Restart in This Language"
msgstr "Shu tilda _qayta ishga tushirish"

#: installer.rs:167
msgid "The live session restarts in the chosen language, and MAN is installed in it."
msgstr "Jonli seans tanlangan tilda qayta ishga tushadi va MAN shu tilda oʻrnatiladi."

#: installer.rs:213
msgid "Welcome to MAN"
msgstr "MAN’ga xush kelibsiz"

#: installer.rs:214
msgid ""
"A fast, open and fully customizable GNOME system.\n"
"Install it on this computer, or keep exploring the live session."
msgstr ""
"Tez, ochiq va toʻliq sozlanadigan GNOME tizimi.\n"
"Uni shu kompyuterga oʻrnating yoki jonli seansni oʻrganishda davom eting."

#: installer.rs:218
msgid "_Install MAN…"
msgstr "MAN’ni _oʻrnatish…"

#: installer.rs:220
msgid "_Keep Trying MAN"
msgstr "MAN’ni sinashda _davom etish"

#: installer.rs:223
msgid "Looking for disks…"
msgstr "Disklar qidirilmoqda…"

#: installer.rs:250
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Xush kelibsiz"

#: installer.rs:265
msgid "This computer was started in legacy BIOS mode. MAN can only be installed on UEFI computers: restart and choose the UEFI boot option."
msgstr "Bu kompyuter eski BIOS rejimida ishga tushirilgan. MAN faqat UEFI kompyuterlarga oʻrnatiladi: qayta ishga tushiring va UEFI yuklash variantini tanlang."

#: installer.rs:283
msgid "The system helper returned no disk information."
msgstr "Tizim yordamchisi disklar haqida maʼlumot qaytarmadi."

#: installer.rs:348
msgid "  ·  EFI"
msgstr "  ·  EFI"

#: installer.rs:356
msgid "_Next"
msgstr "_Keyingi"

#: installer.rs:364
msgid "Erase Disk and Install MAN"
msgstr "Diskni tozalab MAN’ni oʻrnatish"

#: installer.rs:365
msgid "Everything on the chosen disk is deleted, Windows included."
msgstr "Tanlangan diskdagi hamma narsa oʻchiriladi, Windows ham."

#: installer.rs:365
msgid "Recommended. Everything on the chosen disk is deleted."
msgstr "Tavsiya etiladi. Tanlangan diskdagi hamma narsa oʻchiriladi."

#: installer.rs:369
msgid "Install Alongside Windows"
msgstr "Windows yoniga oʻrnatish"

#: installer.rs:370
msgid "Recommended. MAN uses the free space next to Windows; Windows and its files stay. Choose the system at every start."
msgstr "Tavsiya etiladi. MAN Windows yonidagi boʻsh joydan foydalanadi; Windows va uning fayllari qoladi. Har ishga tushirishda tizimni tanlaysiz."

#: installer.rs:377
msgid "Reinstall MAN"
msgstr "MAN’ni qayta oʻrnatish"

#: installer.rs:378
msgid "Replaces the system but keeps personal files in /home. The current system is saved as a snapshot."
msgstr "Tizimni almashtiradi, lekin /home ichidagi shaxsiy fayllarni saqlaydi. Joriy tizim snapshot sifatida saqlanadi."

#: installer.rs:383
msgid "Custom Partitions"
msgstr "Maxsus boʻlimlar"

#: installer.rs:383
msgid "For experts: choose partitions yourself, or create them with Disks."
msgstr "Mutaxassislar uchun: boʻlimlarni oʻzingiz tanlang yoki Disklar bilan yarating."

#: installer.rs:392
msgid "Disk"
msgstr "Disk"

#: installer.rs:392
msgid "Choose the disk to erase. Disks that cannot be used are shown with the reason."
msgstr "Tozalanadigan diskni tanlang. Foydalanib boʻlmaydigan disklar sababi bilan koʻrsatiladi."

#: installer.rs:418
msgid "No disks were found"
msgstr "Disklar topilmadi"

